GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-short

::: post
test("the expired token was renewed with the refresh token", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().grant).toBe("refresh_token");
});

::: docs
Run after `short-1-new`: the stored token has expired, so Postino refreshes it before sending.
The response bar shows "Token renewed".
